ent repair.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:22050","label":"Measure or mix chemicals or compounds in accordance with detailed instructions or formulas.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:22051","label":"Monitor equipment during operation to ensure adherence to specifications for characteristics such as pressure, temperature, or flow.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:22052","label":"Collect or compile nanotechnology research or engineering data.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:22053","label":"Calibrate nanotechnology equipment, such as weighing, testing, or production equipment.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:22054","label":"Monitor hazardous waste cleanup procedures to ensure proper application of nanocomposites or accomplishment of objectives.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:22055","label":"Contribute written material or data for grant or patent applications.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:22056","label":"Inspect or measure thin films of carbon nanotubes, polymers, or inorganic coatings, using a variety of techniques or analytical tools.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:22058","label":"Develop or modify wet chemical or industrial laboratory experimental techniques for nanoscale use.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:22060","label":"Implement new or enhanced methods or processes for the processing, testing, or manufacture of nanotechnology materials or products.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:22061","label":"Prepare detailed verbal or written presentations for scientists, engineers, project managers, or upper management.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:22063","label":"Maintain accurate record or batch-record documentation of nanoproduction.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:22065","label":"Prepare capability data, training materials, or other documentation for transfer of processes to production.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:22068","label":"Assist nanoscientists or engineers in processing or characterizing materials according to physical or chemical properties.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:22069","label":"Assist nanoscientists or engineers in writing process specifications or documentation.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:22057","label":"Compare the performance or environmental impact of nanomaterials by nanoparticle size, shape, or organization.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:22059","label":"Process nanoparticles or nanostructures, using technologies such as ultraviolet radiation, microwave energy, or catalysis.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:22062","label":"Perform functional tests of nano-enhanced assemblies, components, or systems, using equipment such as torque gauges or conductivity meters.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:22064","label":"Assemble components, using techniques such as interference fitting, solvent bonding, adhesive bonding, heat sealing, or ultrasonic welding.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:22066","label":"Analyze the life cycle of nanomaterials or nano-enabled products to determine environmental impact.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:22067","label":"Measure emission of nanodust or nanoparticles during nanocomposite or other nano-scale production processes, using systems such as aerosol detection systems.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"}],"signals":[],"targets":[{"occ":{"i